{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"InnoRouter’s test stores follow TCA’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TestStore"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustivity model:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events collected from the underlying authority’s unified "},{"code":"onEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"callback accumulate in an internal queue. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"receive(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call dequeues the next event and asserts a predicate. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"code":".strict","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" mode, the store reports events left pending at ","type":"text"},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"deallocation."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"assertNoPendingEvents()"},{"type":"text","text":" is a non-terminal checkpoint: it reports and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consumes the current pending snapshot, then continues observing. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"finish()"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closes the queue, consumes its final snapshot, and reports the first event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"emitted after that boundary in both exhaustivity modes."}]},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Testing currently attributes issues recorded inside an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"isolated ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deinit"},{"type":"text","text":" to an "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"unknown test","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rather than to the test that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owned the store, which makes a deinit-time leftover-event failure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hard to locate. Until that is resolved upstream, await all work and end"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each test with an explicit "},{"code":"finish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". It runs the strict check with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller’s source location and disarms the deinit-time fallback."}]}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.runtime\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.runtime\/documentation\/InnoRouterTesting"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Controls how strictly a test store checks pending events when observation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finishes.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.runtime\/SQ","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.runtime\/SH","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.runtime\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/com.innosquad.innorouter.docs.runtime\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/innoroutertesting\/testexhaustivity"]}],"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/InnoSquadCorp\/InnoRouter\/blob\/6.0.0\/Sources\/InnoRouterTesting\/TestExhaustivity.swift#L25","fileName":"TestExhaustivity.swift"},"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TestExhaustivity","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":